ue to the thresholds and how can I calculate them, as many posts would worte smth like order_mts | 1.3*t1 + 3.7*ts, which I don&#39;t understand<span><span></span></span><br><span><span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0)\"><code><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:medium none currentcolor;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span><br></span></span></pre></code></span></div>"
